/figure><figure><img alt=\"2026年11月7日，踏入「立冬」本港天氣和暖，市區氣溫26度至29度。（方承恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261107/1195785779805163520973208.jpeg/U9_XWhbNfQSXkfyZb8Mb062AjRnJMfnQoeG6SYThukk\"/><figcaption>2026年11月7日，踏入「立冬」本港天氣和暖，市區氣溫26度至29度。（方承恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2026年11月7日，踏入「立冬」本港天氣和暖，市區氣溫26度至29度。（方承恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261107/1195785768149192704738492.jpeg/hL1g7bGDazdgxgC4wHtWTbQfJHLpLoNkFPzTMDH80zA\"/><figcaption>2026年11月7日，踏入「立冬」本港天氣和暖，市區氣溫26度至29度。（方承恩攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:52:37.953671+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3350,"images":37,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T04:32:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T07:07:39.555223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:46:09.258836+00:00","content_hash":"b875a28632c9af9a698d47e55d2c876cea03a454c095b54ec41442908e135aa1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}